            "review_text": "Canadian-in-Blighty\nCheltenham, United Kingdom291 contributions\n0\nA terrific restaurant\nNov 2015 • Business\nThe restaurant is a large outdoor terraced restaurant serving an enormous variety of fish and seafood. \n\nThe restaurant is very popular with the people of DaNang. \n\nThe restaurant has a series of outdoor fish and seafood tanks from which your dinner will be selected so there is no question of freshness. \n\nThe ambience is terrific with smiles and laughter all around.\n\nI have been to the restaurant 4 or 5 times and always been pleased.\nRead more\nWritten November 8, 2015",
